.Dd 2025-09-30
.Dt PROVIDER-KEM 7ossl
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm provider-kem
.Nd The kem library \(la-\(ra provider functions
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.In openssl/core_dispatch.h
.In openssl/core_names.h
